[
  {
    "id": "1670550ad67fb7e9f9",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "我会陪你认识每一位朋友。点一张图卡，看看它最容易认出的特征。",
    "file": "1670550ad67fb7e9f9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "52ecbbf243f739972f",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "这是同一设计的两头成年牛，只改变大小。big / small 说的是大小。",
    "file": "52ecbbf243f739972f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "7acdc0464d9d5a4c74",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "开心、生气、难过，都可以说出来。再看看 funny 和 happy 有什么不同。",
    "file": "7acdc0464d9d5a4c74.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "b2e4ab4a5ec0340604",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "先说它怎么样，再说它是什么，最后说它有什么。我们一直看同一张图。",
    "file": "b2e4ab4a5ec0340604.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "6f2a0dc8dca9d9e1a8",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "It is small.",
    "file": "6f2a0dc8dca9d9e1a8.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "40b4a01082e7b13739",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "一个动物用 It is，多只用 They are。说多只动物时，不保留 a。",
    "file": "40b4a01082e7b13739.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "0951da8336a99e373d",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "It is a cow.",
    "file": "0951da8336a99e373d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "5c41b1ef29cc6cd486",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "短回答保留 has，不用再加 got。图换了，回答也可能变化。",
    "file": "5c41b1ef29cc6cd486.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "b4ca8a82af8ee270bd",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Has it got a long tail?",
    "file": "b4ca8a82af8ee270bd.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "c41adbde47bac26d28",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "先数腿，再观察耳朵或颜色。不要只看第一条线索就着急回答。",
    "file": "c41adbde47bac26d28.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "9356b59985e76a4394",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "每增加一只动物，介绍卡都会跟着变化。看看两只绵羊的名字怎么写。",
    "file": "9356b59985e76a4394.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "7df655702191306d8e",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "请帮我找到 donkey。先想起它的样子。",
    "file": "7df655702191306d8e.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "39c411cf00dd4bc21f",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "请帮我找到 sheep。先想起它的样子。",
    "file": "39c411cf00dd4bc21f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "749cc1ea7aba0fc157",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "请帮我找到 duck。先想起它的样子。",
    "file": "749cc1ea7aba0fc157.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "545a65479b9c216353",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "请帮我找到 goat。先想起它的样子。",
    "file": "545a65479b9c216353.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "50426c09fc8f9f4799",
    "lang": "zh",
