  },
  {
    "id": "4b4a9be9c9679ae488",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "这是一只羊驼。",
    "file": "4b4a9be9c9679ae488.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "d195b33e223786eb03",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "It has got four legs and long hair.",
    "file": "d195b33e223786eb03.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "ac2f5c043e567ab2f1",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "它有四条腿，还有长长的毛。",
    "file": "ac2f5c043e567ab2f1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "30b53b7a398b0ddd61",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Alpacas live in Peru.",
    "file": "30b53b7a398b0ddd61.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "01c5890e5256bffd98",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "秘鲁有羊驼生活。",
    "file": "01c5890e5256bffd98.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "6c25890d6d50c305cb",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "We can make clothes from alpaca wool.",
    "file": "6c25890d6d50c305cb.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "c178466e9c6e4dc01a",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "羊驼毛可以用来制作衣物。",
    "file": "c178466e9c6e4dc01a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "7b04ec00d610f3ecb0",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Cathy is a young cow. The flies bother her.",
    "file": "7b04ec00d610f3ecb0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "1350459e72a98e1d57",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "凯西是一头小母牛。苍蝇不停打扰她，她很不舒服。",
    "file": "1350459e72a98e1d57.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "abfecb80ae636d5ad1",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Cathy is a young cow.",
    "file": "abfecb80ae636d5ad1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "b6e2c9ed641ffa0d25",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "The flies bother her.",
    "file": "b6e2c9ed641ffa0d25.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "11aa06855e0aa3da2f",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "flies",
    "file": "11aa06855e0aa3da2f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "449126ddc199cc4fe8",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "A nice horse helps Cathy. They find some mud.",
    "file": "449126ddc199cc4fe8.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "9f25dca9e565144a15",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "一匹友好的马来帮助凯西。它们找到了一处泥地。",
    "file": "9f25dca9e565144a15.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "a28c47b0233b7d7a67",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "A nice horse helps Cathy.",
    "file": "a28c47b0233b7d7a67.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "6a7e33888d0e429d27",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "They find some mud.",
    "file": "6a7e33888d0e429d27.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "757c8856212e5fadff",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Cathy jumps in the mud. She is happy.",
    "file": "757c8856212e5fadff.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "d7624e4faf90a84088",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "凯西跳进泥地，玩得很开心。棕色的泥巴溅到了她身上。",
    "file": "d7624e4faf90a84088.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "5ad68a581280fcfbf5",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Cathy jumps in the mud.",
    "file": "5ad68a581280fcfbf5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "e721beb2f657723c86",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "She is happy.",
    "file": "e721beb2f657723c86.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "137ce1557d93543a3d",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "The other cows laugh. Cathy is sad.",
    "file": "137ce1557d93543a3d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "c6ec8d917f15d41155",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "其他的牛笑她身上脏脏的泥点。凯西很难过。",
    "file": "c6ec8d917f15d41155.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "63331bb53fb75bb815",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "The other cows laugh.",
    "file": "63331bb53fb75bb815.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "cea69a43319833e8dd",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "Cathy is sad.",
    "file": "cea69a43319833e8dd.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "c9e2d89d8fe92398d2",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "The horse stays with Cathy. The flies bother the other cows.",
    "file": "c9e2d89d8fe92398d2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "0f414bda75d769692d",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "马留在凯西身边。苍蝇又来打扰其他的牛了。",
    "file": "0f414bda75d769692d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "3ccffc08811645c3e4",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "The horse stays with Cathy.",
    "file": "3ccffc08811645c3e4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "f476d8f5547f5325c1",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "The flies bother the other cows.",
    "file": "f476d8f5547f5325c1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "3b22897a9dab327520",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "The cows play in the mud together. They are happy.",
    "file": "3b22897a9dab327520.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "37b5d9c3a4979ef79a",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "其他的牛也加入泥地游戏，大家开心地玩在一起。",
    "file": "37b5d9c3a4979ef79a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "dfc8b69b4e617b4d69",
    "lang": "en",
    "text": "The cows play in the mud together.",
    "file": "dfc8b69b4e617b4d69.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "d44fe118190ad3fd3b",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "先听完整单词，再留意高亮的字母。听一听这些单词共同的短促辅音。不要把字母名称当作它们在单词里的声音。",
    "file": "d44fe118190ad3fd3b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "1f8025f8f7aff627e5",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "把动物和它们带来的食物或材料配成一对。羊毛可以制成衣物；羊驼也有可以利用的毛。",
    "file": "1f8025f8f7aff627e5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "63613079b4c38a58d9",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "先听一幅，再讲一幅。看看事情怎样改变凯西的心情，也想想怎样友好地帮助朋友。",
    "file": "63613079b4c38a58d9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "515e70839e97190b95",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "听单词，看看图，再自己拼一拼。每填一个字母，数一数还差几个。",
    "file": "515e70839e97190b95.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "644408d2f5414762b5",
    "lang": "zh",
    "text": "先独立试一试。答错可以再听、再看；这一轮的第一次选择会记入结果，帮助你找到需要复习的内容。",
    "file": "644408d2f5414762b5.mp3"
  }
]
